                {
                  "text": "25.8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " wonti akanatiifi Ilmeeni Hoola ta jiddu barch'uma guddinna jirtu worraa tissite, gara bisaani jireenna geesiti; duuba Waaqi imimaani ch'ufa ila worra iraa haaqa.",
          "type": "text",
